name 'building-data-driven-systems-postassessment-q5_2025'

question 'A developer wants to create a "Undo" feature that removes the most recently added item from a list. Which array method is most appropriate?'

right '`.pop()`'
wrong '`.push()`'
wrong '`.shift()`'
wrong '`.unshift()`'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 3

`.pop()` removes the last element from an array, which corresponds to the "most recent" item added via `.push()`
MARKDOWN
